    <item>
      <title>CyberChef · Visual Recipes</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/docs/tools-cheatsheet/cyberchef-cheatsheet/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/tools-cheatsheet/cyberchef-cheatsheet/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;cyberchef-visual-cheatsheet&#34;&gt;CyberChef Visual Cheatsheet&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#cyberchef-visual-cheatsheet&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Input bytes → ordered recipe → inspect output → save exact bytes.&lt;/strong&gt; Start with one transformation suggested by the data. Magic is a hypothesis generator, not proof of a correct decode.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../ajcbbc_allow_tools/cyberchef/&#34;&gt;Existing CyberChef tool note&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef/&#34;&gt;Official app&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef&#34;&gt;Official project / offline release&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-know-the-four-panels&#34;&gt;1. Know the four panels&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-know-the-four-panels&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/tools/cyberchef-base64.png&#34; alt=&#34;Real CyberChef screenshot: From Base64 transforms ZmxhZ3tkZW1vfQ== into flag{demo}&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual browser screenshot captured during this update, using only synthetic demo input. UI layout may differ on the tournament&amp;rsquo;s installed build.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>39 Tools · Technique Map</title>
